[00:37.98] Wonder if I said the right things
[00:55.04] With this wound i've bled so much
[01:10.12] Words are all that we have left for us
[01:28.36] Wonder why you had to be in such a rush
[01:41.70] I'll march into my graveyard
[01:48.78] And bury you now
[01:57.08] The last man standing
[02:05.12] But not the last one laughing
[02:13.30] While worms eat your body
[02:19.90] And the fog covers your grave
[02:28.16] I'll still be trying
[02:38.54] To get your laugh out of my head
[02:47.28] I just need some more
[02:50.12] Just need some more time
[03:05.00] Its not how we should say goodbye
[03:10.84] Wasted my time
[03:19.64] And I thought you were stronger
[03:28.24] Than ones before
[03:33.96] I said that I needed some time
[03:41.06] I didnt expect you to quit
[03:45.20] Now that I lost you
[03:51.10] It feels like I lost myself
[03:58.42] I found regret
[04:16.24] Answers we'll never get
